.git/
.github/
# `docker/**` rather than `docker/`: the negation below can only re-include a
# file when its parent directory itself is not excluded. Only the DBA DDL ships
# (an operator may need it from inside the image); the dev compose file and the
# legacy sample rows stay out.
docker/**
!docker/schema.sql
docs/
plans/
.dockerignore
CNAME
Dockerfile
README.md
LICENSE
# SPA: sources are needed by the Docker build stage, generated output is not.
ui/node_modules/
ui/dist/
ui/coverage/
ui/playwright-report/
ui/test-results/
public/app/
# Local attachment storage must never ship in an image.
var/
